//! Entries slice — Batch 225 (Plan 227) — the Prism `Q1_0` trio distill:
//! the founding-infrastructure commit `59f2b8485` (v0.0.1-prism,
//! 2026-03-02: `Q1_0` + `Q1_0_g128` 1-bit sign-based quant, CPU + Metal +
//! CUDA, 29 files +1382/−1) plus the `[cuda] fix mmq/mma path` commit
//! `43e67bda3` (2026-03-13: the accuracy fix that enabled the kernels).
//! Source PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp (MIT); every quote re-verified at the
//! pin clone this session (git-show blob reads at both pins; the merge
//! `bc8122e43a` is CUDA-only boilerplate — no content beyond its
//! parents).
//!
//! FIVE OWN RULES + the batch's riders live on their hosts (see the
//! research note): the dispatcher-eligibility stub face (`gpu_16`), the
//! x86 expansion face + the mismatched-block face (`gpu_33`), the
//! vendor-view int32-wrap face (`gpu_02`), the processing-set staging
//! predicate (the popcorn contiguity-guard host).
//!
//! DEDUP (re-run at authoring, 3+ vocabularies): `tile loader thread
//! map` / `threads_per_row` / `loader geometry` — ZERO corpus hits;
//! the nearest neighbors are the stride-meaning and version-guard
//! correctness classes (D). `pre-expand` / `int8 tile reuse` /
//! `mma consumer reuse` — the fewrow tensor-tile rule (B198) owns
//! decode fused into a vendor COOPERATIVE-tensor operand for a verify
//! band; THIS reuses the stock MMQ smem tile + the battle-tested
//! consumer via layout mimicry (compose, never merge). `scale
//! replication` / `broadcast scale` / `scale slot` — the scale-fold
//! family (per-row-scale-folded-into-rhs-staging-tile folds
//! arithmetically; hoist-row-invariant-scale moves to the epilogue);
//! THIS is layout BROADCAST into consumer scale slots. `sign expand`
//! / `symmetric epilogue` / `dp4a 1-bit` — the popcount rule owns the
//! LATER Metal consume (d0ce941ec); the base-3 dp4a pair owns bias
//! algebras a symmetric format does not need; the ±1-as-lane consume
//! and the no-offset epilogue are unowned. `mean abs` / `shared
//! magnitude` / `sign codec scale` — the popcorn ternary-weight rule owns
//! scale = 1/mean(|w|) as a multiplicative INVERSE for a ternary threshold
//! codec; HERE the mean IS the minimizer of the sign reconstruction's
//! residual, stored directly.

